    |               ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Ordinary fallible calls propagate automatically; `AuthError` can reach `Err` only through `impl Err.From(AuthError)`
 Fix: Handle this call locally with `??`, add `impl Err.From(AuthError) { … }`, or change the return type
